ng Back Substitution"}] :question/id #uuid "3719eef8-ec9e-5d13-b3ad-dc6ee7926695" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n    \n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} &=4 \\\\ {x}_{2}+{x}_{3} &=2 \\\\ {x}_{3} &=-2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"}] [#edb/ref 17592186575703 #edb/ref 17592186265751 {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265751 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096671 :knowledge-point/title "Solving a System of Equations Given an Augmented Matrix Containing Non-Unit Leading Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "767893ce-f15e-5dc3-ac2a-90c7bba1c030" :question/problem "Solve the system of equations represented by the augmented matrix: \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}] [#edb/ref 17592186575703 #edb/ref 17592186265752 {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265752 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186096671 :knowledge-point/title "Solving a System of Equations Given an Augmented Matrix Containing Non-Unit Leading Entries"}] :question/id #uuid "a5bd3a7f-0603-5a94-9bbf-0a46b897e249" :question/problem "Solve the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+4{x}_{3} &=-1 \\\\ {x}_{2}+2{x}_{3} &=-3 \\\\ -{x}_{3} &=-1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$"}] [#edb/ref 17592186574937 #edb/ref 17592186265796 {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265796 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059771 :knowledge-point/title "Applying Row Operations To a Coefficients Matrix"}] :question/id #uuid "1b5f24a7-25be-5f91-9261-490e6919b435" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A,$ given by\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 2 & 7 \\\\ 7 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 9 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation ${R}_{3}:=\\frac{1}{3}{R}_{3}$ on $A?$"}] [#edb/ref 17592186627939 #edb/ref 17592186265942 {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265942 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186161966 :knowledge-point/title "Using Column Ope